# Local secrets for `wrangler dev` / `vite preview`. Copy to .dev.vars (which
# is git-ignored) and fill in. Names only here; never commit a value.
#
# Nothing is needed yet: Phase 1 (the database foundation) uses no secrets.
# Phase 2 (Google sign-in) will add, per environment:
#
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OAUTH_COOKIE_KEY=
#
# Staging and production get theirs with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`
# (add `--env staging` for staging) and each has its own values.
